<title>USA: Premier Laser names Michael Hiebert CFO.</title>
<headline>Premier Laser names Michael Hiebert CFO.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premier Laser Systems Inc said Friday that Michael Hiebert has been appointed chief financial officer, vice president finance and treasurer, effective November 6.</p>
<p>Hiebert, a former vice president with Urethane Technologies Inc of Santa Ana, California, replaces James Polentz, who Premier said left to pursue other business opportunities.</p>
</text>
